<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 360 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 360 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Treasury raised 360 million dirhams at its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Friday.</p>
<p>RATES AND AMOUNTS (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	 AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    52 weeks	   8	    8		   8.00</p>
<p>    Five years     202	  202		   9.00</p>
<p>    10 years	 120	  120		   9.50</p>
<p>    15 years	  30	   30		   9.75</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	    360	  360</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for August 21.</p>
<p>($1= 9.86 dirhams)</p>
</text>
